    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game plunges players into a deep, dark blue ocean world where they take on the role of a courageous platypus navigating through this challenging aquatic environment. In the game, players use the space bar to make the platypus jump at the right moments, carefully maneuvering through a sea filled with pipes. These pipes serve as the main obstacles, and players must control the timing of their jumps precisely to pass through safely. The farther the platypus advances, the higher the score the player earns. The game features exquisite visuals, with a deep blue background contrasting beautifully with the vibrant colors of the platypus, creating a mysterious and captivating atmosphere. The background music is soft and enigmatic, complemented by timely sound effects, such as the crisp sound of the platypus jumping, providing an immersive gaming experience. This is a game that tests players' reaction speed while also offering a relaxing and engaging experience.</p>",
